{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "How can you tell?": "",
  "Eh, I have a nose for these things.": "",
  "I have a nose for these things.": "",
  "Not me. Chairman Kajihira. He needs to know\nwhat's up with your investigation.": "",
  "Chairman Kajihira's the one who's looking for you.\nHe needs to know what's up with your investigation.": "",
  "Honmaruen's burnt to a crisp.\nShioya-san's dead.": "",
  "Honmaruen's burnt to a crisp,\nShioya-san's dead...": "",
  "The chairman is very interested\nto know what happened.": "",
  "As the losses pile up,\nthe chairman's upset to say the least.": "",
  "No surprise there.": "",
  "...I bet.": "",
  "How about that.": "",
  "A police detective\ncum serial murderer.": "",
  "So the Mole was a police detective\nall along?": "",
  "If you're telling the truth... There's a trail\nof death following AD-9 every step of the way.": "",
  "If everything you're telling me is true...\nAD-9 has a lot of bodies in its wake.": "",
  "It all leads back to the human experiments.\nThe patient Shono killed, Waku-san. Emi Terasawa.": "",
  "Yoji Shono's the one behind all the deaths.\nEmi Terasawa, Vice-director Hashiki, Shintani...": "",
  "Hashiki from the ADDC. Shintani.\nEvery single one of them.": "",
  "Every last one of them was a\nhuman experiment for AD-9.": "",
  "Maybe so... but without evidence, this is nothing\nmore than a well-crafted hypothesis.": "",
  "But without evidence, all this is just\na well-crafted hypothesis.": "",
  "Believe me, I know that already.": "",
  "All right, I've heard what you have to say.\nBut Chairman Kajihira still wants to meet with you.": "",
  "Well, you've made your point. But...\nChairman Kajihira still wants to meet with you.": "",
  "I just told you everything I know.": "",
  "Then you can tell it to him, too.": "",
  "In that case, you can tell him as well.": "",
  "I'm little more than a messenger, after all.": "",
  "I'm just the messenger here.": "",
  "Listen, Yagami-san.\nChairman Kajihira isn't your enemy.": "",
  "You should know he isn't your enemy.": "",
  "He may even have details\nyou wouldn't otherwise be privy to.": "",
  "He may even help you fill in some details that\nyou wouldn't otherwise be privy to.": "",
  "I suggest you milk that\nfor what it's worth.": "",
  "Oh, and put a good word in for me,\nhuh? If you don't mind.": "",
  "And if you don't mind...\nput in a good word for me?": "",
  "Are you free to meet now? You'll need\nto bring Kaito-san too, of course.": "",
  "Are you free to meet now?\nYou'll need to bring Kaito-san.": "",
  "It seems his bullet wound\nhas almost fully healed.": "",
  "From the sounds of things,\nhe's back on his feet...": "",
  "You really do know everything.": "",
  "What can I say, comes with the job.\nAnyway, grab Kaito-san and head to Kikunoya.": "",
  "Comes with the job. Grab Kaito-san and\nhead to Kikunoya when you're ready.": "",
  "Kikunoya...?": "",
  "I hear Patriarch Matsugane loved the place.\nCoincidentally, so does the chairman.": "",
  "I hear Patriarch Matsugane loved the place.\nCoincidentally, so does Chairman Kajihira.": "",
  "Goodbye, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Yo, I'm gonna make some coffee.\nYou want a cup?": "",
  "Yo. I'm makin' coffee.\nWant some?": "",
  "Hey, aren't you supposed\nto be recovering?": "",
  "Sure, but aren't you recovering?": "",
  "Eh, it's fine.\nC'mon, drink with me.": "",
  "Eh, I'm fine.\nHave a cup.": "",
  "If you say so...\nBy the way, Hattori just dropped by.": "",
  "Sure. By the way,\nHattori just dropped by.": "",
  "The journalist?": "",
  "Yeah. Apparently Chairman Kajihira\nis asking for us.": "",
  "Chairman Kajihira wants us,\naccording to him.": "",
  "What I hear, Kajihira's\nin a pretty tough spot right now.": "",
  "From what I hear, Chairman Kajihira's got\na real situation on his hands.": "",
  "Chairman Koba from the Kyorei Clan's putting the pressure on.\nI mean, their captain Shioya just got his eyes gouged out.": "",
  "Chairman Koba from the Kyorei Clan's pressuring him.\nI mean, Captain Shioya just got his eyes gouged out.": "",
  "Never woulda happened if Kajihira\nhadn't shipped him up to Kamurocho.": "",
  "If Kajihira didn't ship him out to Kamurocho,\nit never would've happened.": "",
  "Yeah... I guess so.": "",
  "First a couple of their rookies die in Kamurocho,\nthen a captain turns up dead...": "",
  "Chairman Koba's probably freaking\nthe fuck out.": "",
  "Chairman Koba's probably\nfreaking the fuck out.": "",
  "Guess Kajihira's calling us\nto fix it, then?": "",
  "So Kajihira calls us? Are we really\ngetting involved in that?": "",
  "Dunno.\nWe'll find out when we get there.": "",
  "Dunno. We'll find out\nwhen we get there.": "",
  "...We?": "",
  "You're coming too?": "",
  "I'm sick of sittin' around watching Kuroiwa,\nman. We're not getting anywhere with this shit.": "",
  "Yeah. I can't just sit and watch Kuroiwa.\nAin't gettin' us anywhere.": "",
  "It's time we try somethin' new.": "",
  "It's about time we try somethin' new.": "",
  "Hell, I'll do whatever it takes\nto avenge Matsugane-san.": "",
  "I gotta get revenge for the boss somehow.\nI'll do whatever it takes.": "",
  "We goin' to Kikunoya?\nAll right.": "",
  "Welcome. I've been waiting for you.": "",
  "It's truly horrible what\nhappened to Matsugane-san.": "",
  "The loss of Matsugane-san was a tragedy.": "",
  "To his memory.": "",
  "A toast to his memory.": "",
  "Chairman Kajihira. I assume you've\nalready heard about AD-9?": "",
  "Chairman Kajihira. I assume you've already\nheard about AD-9?": "",
  "Yes. Hattori-san told me everything.": "",
  "The incident three years ago\nwas a human experiment gone awry, huh?": "",
  "The incident three years ago was\nhuman experiment gone awry?": "",
  "I'm impressed you figured that out.\nQuite impressed.": "",
  "I heard about Shinpei Okubo, too.": "",
  "The murderer you let loose upon the world\ndidn't actually kill anyone.": "",
  "The murderer you let loose upon the world...\nWell, I suppose he didn't actually kill anyone?": "",
  "Yeah. Emi died at the hands of Shono,\nthe AD-9 researcher.": "",
  "Yeah. It was Shono. Emi Terasawa died\nfor the sake of AD-9.": "",
  "I'm not so sure about that.\nDo you have any proof? No?": "",
  "I'm not so sure about that. I don't suppose\nyou have any proof to back that up?": "",
  "If I did I'd be making\nyou eat those words.": "",
  "If I had solid proof, I'd already have\nthrown it in your face.": "",
  "Come now, no fighting.\nMy old heart can't handle the stress.": "",
  "Hold on a sec, old man.": "",
  "If you already know what's goin' on,\nwhy'd you go n' call us out here?": "",
  "What do you really want?": "",
  "Heh, you're sharper than you look. To be honest,\nI have a bit of a problem on my hands.": "",
  "You're sharper than you look.\nI do have one problem...": "",
  "The Kyorei chairman, Koba,\nhas been getting on my case.": "",
  "It's the Kyorei Clan chairman, Koba.": "",
  "He wants me to put a button\non all this murder business.": "",
  "He wants this Mole business\ntaken care of.": "",
  "Not that I can blame him. His successor\njust had his eyes gouged out, after all.": "",
  "Though considering Shioya's grisly end, and even\nhaving his eyes gouged out... I can't blame him.": "",
  "What's your point?": "",
  "I want you to bring an end to these killings.\nThat detective, Kuroiwa, is behind it all, right?": "",
  "I want you to bring an end to the Mole.\nIt's that Detective Kuroiwa, right?": "",
  "Whaddya take us for, assassins?": "",
  "You for real?\nWhaddya take us for, assassins?": "",
  "I have confidence that the two\nof you can do what I ask.": "",
  "Oh, I'm sure you could manage it.": "",
  "What do you say?\nI'll give you a handsome reward.": "",
  "Well? I'll give you a handsome reward.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Tch. He's as much\na yakuza as any of 'em.)</color>": "",
  "...Yeah, I think we'll be going now.": "",
  "All right, all right!\nIt was a joke.": "",
  "Oh, fine, fine! It was a joke.": "",
  "Though the Kyorei Clan\nhas been getting on my case.": "",
  "Though the Kyorei Clan <font_kind=yakuza_italic>has</font_kind> been\ngetting on my case.": "",
  "So you were half-joking.": "",
  "So you were only half-joking.": "",
  "Heh. The real reason I called\nthe two of you here...": "",
  "...The real reason I called\nthe two of you here...": "",
  "...Was to say thanks.\nIn Hashiki's place.": "",
  "...was to say thank you in Hashiki's place.": "",
  "It must be frustrating for him to look down on this world\njust to see people say he died in a drunken brawl.": "",
  "It must be frustrating for him to look down upon the world,\nonly for people to say he died in a drunken brawl.": "",
  "But you saw through that false narrative.": "",
  "But you saw through the lies.\nYou found the truth of his death.": "",
  "Once we have proof and crush AD-9\nfor good, he'll finally be avenged.": "",
  "Once we have the proof to crush AD-9 for good,\nhe'll finally be avenged.": "",
  "And you'll finally make good\non your 100 billion yen investment.": "",
  "And you'll finally make good on your\n100 billion yen investment, of course.": "",
  "Not that I care either way.": "",
  "So, Yagami-san.\nWhat comes next?": "",
  "So what's your next move, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Well, Ayabe's trial is coming up, right?": "",
  "We'll use that stage to bring the real crimes into\nthe spotlight. That'll also mean lifting the veil on AD-9.": "",
  "That's our opportunity. We'll use that stage to bring the real crimes\ninto the spotlight. If we can do that, we'll lift the veil on AD-9.": "",
  "Okubo'll be in the clear, too.": "",
  "And more than that,\nOkubo'll be in the clear.": "",
  "Interesting. I think you're still\nmissing some evidence, though.": "",
  "Interesting. I think you're still missing\nsome evidence, though.": "",
  "You're not wrong.\nWe don't know where Hamura is, either.": "",
  "...You're not wrong. We don't know\nwhere Hamura is, either.": "",
  "Well then? What now?": "",
  "Well then, what now?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(If we want to expose the secrets of AD-9,\nthere's one man we have to chase down.)</color>": "",
  "I'm gonna keep going after Kuroiwa.\nStay on his tail 'til I get a solid lead.": "",
  "You may be waiting a long time, then.\nHe's not the type of man to slip up.": "",
  "Well, you may be waiting a long time.\nHe's not the type of man to slip up.": "",
  "I know. It'll take some time for sure,\nbut there's no other way.": "",
  "I'm not sure you have\nthe time you think you do.": "",
  "I'm not sure you have the time\nyou think you do.": "",
  "...What do you mean?": "",
  "It won't be long until\nShinpei Okubo is executed.": "",
  "Shinpei Okubo... doesn't have\nmuch time left.": "",
  "So say my connections, at least.": "",
  "There's a top-secret list stating which death row\ninmates are potential execution candidates for the near future.": "",
  "You see... there's a top-secret list stating which death row inmates\nare potential execution candidates.": "",
  "Apparently Okubo is on that list.": "",
  "Once the Minister of Justice rubberstamps\nthe execution, it's over.": "",
  "The Minister of Justice\njust needs to approve it.": "",
  "What? But why!?": "",
  "What? Why?": "",
  "Someone must have pressured\nthe ministry to put Okubo on the list.": "",
  "Someone must have pressured the ministry\nto put Okubo on the list.": "",
  "Dammit! If I don't do something soon,\nI'm gonna lose my chance forever...": "",
  "Dammit!\nThen we have to act now, or...": "",
  "If it were me, I'd try going after\nan easier target than Kuroiwa.": "",
  "If it were up to me, I'd try going after\nan easier target than Kuroiwa.": "",
  "And who would that be?": "",
  "Look. This is an article\nof mine that got scrapped.": "",
  "Take a look at this. This is an article of mine\nthat got scrapped.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(\"Researcher Mired in Scandal\"?\n\"Millions of Yen Paid in Hush Money\"?)</color>": "",
  "Kido-san? Really?": "",
  "...Wait, really? Kido-san?": "",
  "His womanizing ways are actually pretty well-known.\nGuess he's really cut loose since they announced AD-9.": "",
  "His womanizing habits are actually pretty well-known.\nGuess he's really cut loose since they announced AD-9.": "",
  "Underneath the lab coat he's nothing but a\nshameless pervert. If anything <font_kind=yakuza_italic>he's</font_kind> the one you should be going after.": "",
  "Underneath the lab coat he's nothing but a shameless horndog.\nKuroiwa's not that vulnerable, but maybe <font_kind=yakuza_italic>he</font_kind> is.": "",
  "No way am I getting into\nthe ADDC, though. Not now.": "",
  "But I can't get back into the ADDC.\nI've played that card already.": "",
  "Then you'll just have to lure him out.": "",
  "Well then, Yagami-san, you'll just\nhave to lure him out.": "",
  "That's the only way to get\na cautious quarry to leave its nest.": "",
  "That's the only way to get a\ncautious quarry to leave its nest.": "",
  "And how're we gonna do that?": "",
  "Offer him a delicious meal.\nFor Kido, that would be...": "",
  "All you need is the perfect bait to tempt him out.\nFor Kido, that would be...": "",
  "A woman.\nA beautiful one, ideally.": "",
  "A woman. A beautiful one, ideally.": "",
  "Well that was the last place\nI expected to get any good advice.": "",
  "Weird guy to take advice from.": "",
  "Yeah. He had a point, though.\nKido might be our best bet for evidence.": "",
  "Yup. But he might be right about Kido.\nThat could help us get more evidence.": "",
  "Evidence that could reveal\nthe truth about AD-9...": "",
  "We're gonna have to drag\nhim outta the ADDC first.": "",
  "We're gonna have to drag him\noutta the ADDC first.": "",
  "Hattori suggested seducing\nhim to Kamurocho...": "",
  "Through seduction? Will that\nget him to Kamurocho?": "",
  "A honey trap, huh? Guess it's time\nfor Saori-san to do her thing again.": "",
  "A honey trap, huh?\nYou don't think...": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hope Kamurocho's number one\nhostess has a few more tricks up her sleeve.)</color>": "",
  "Yeah. I'll ask her tomorrow.": "",
  "I'll ask Saori-san... first thing tomorrow.": "",
  "Well, I'm all outta gas for tonight.\nSeeya tomorrow, man.": "",
  "Yeah, I'm all outta gas for tonight.\nAll right, see ya.": "",
  "Oh... Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hey, Saori-san...": "",
  "I have another favor\nI wanna ask you.": "",
  "I have another favor I wanna ask you...": "",
  "A favor?": "",
  "Think you can handle it?": "",
  "Tell me what \"it\" is.": "",
  "All right then. We need you\nto set a honey trap for Kido.": "",
  "Here's the thing... Saori-san, we need you\nto set a honey trap for Kido.": "",
  "A... what?": "",
  "A honey trap?": "",
  "It's when you seduce\na man to get information.": "",
  "It's when you seduce a man\nto get information.": "",
  "And you're sure you want <font_kind=yakuza_italic>me</font_kind>?": "",
  "You want <font_kind=yakuza_italic>me</font_kind> for this?": "",
  "How could you ask her to do that?": "",
  "Saori-san, a honey trap!?": "",
  "You can't be serious.": "",
  "Hey, seriously?": "",
  "Look, we need to get to Kido somehow.": "",
  "Look, we need Kido out of the ADDC.": "",
  "This is the best shot we have\nof luring him into Kamurocho.": "",
  "This is our best shot at\nluring him into Kamurocho.": "",
  "Don't be ridiculous! Asking her to be a hostess is\none thing, but you can't make her sleep with that creep!": "",
  "Don't be ridiculous! Asking her to be a hostess is one thing,\nbut you can't make her sleep with that creep!": "",
  "Hold on there, Hoshino-kun.": "",
  "Whoa whoa whoa, hold your horses.": "",
  "Isn't that what a honey trap is!?": "",
  "I never said that.": "",
  "You don't have to listen\nto them, Saori-san.": "",
  "Saori-san, you don't have to\nlisten to them.": "",
  "I mean, just talking about this\nis practically entrapment!": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "How can you tell?": "รู้ได้ยังไงคะ?",
  "No surprise there.": "ไม่แปลกใจเลยสักนิด",
  "What's your point?": "แกจะพูดอะไรกันแน่?",
  "...What do you mean?": "...หมายความว่าไง?",
  "What? Why?": "อะไรนะ? ทำไม?",
  "And who would that be?": "แล้วใครคือแชมป์ล่ะ?",
  "And how're we gonna do that?": "แล้วเราจะทำแบบนั้นได้ยังไง?",
  "A favor?": "ขอร้องอะไรเหรอ?",
  "A... what?": "โม... อะไรนะ?",
